    {\fontsize{22}{28}\selectfont\color{textdark} India --- Fastest-Growing Digital Market}\\[2pt]
    {\fontsize{20}{26}\selectfont\color{textgray} 62\% Penetration \quad$\bullet$\quad 16\% of global users}\vspace{8pt}
